  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Management and Monitoring of Development Cooperation Effectiveness and Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Support to the Ministry of Finance and Economic Affairs to establish a system to monitoring development finance flows by developing an operational and effective development cooperation information management system (DCIMS) to be implemented in line with the principles of the Global Partnership for Effective Development Cooperation (GPEDC) and the Addis Ababa Action Agenda (AAAA).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
